        <item>
            <title><![CDATA[Loon4Mac TCP 性能测试]]></title>
            <link>https://loon0x00.github.io/blog/loon4mac-tcp-performance</link>
            <guid>https://loon0x00.github.io/blog/loon4mac-tcp-performance</guid>
            <pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 03:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[Loon4Mac 在 Apple M1 Max 上的本地 TCP 性能，以及自动和手动测试方法。]]></description>
            <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Loon4Mac build 1007 对 TCP 转发性能进行了优化。在 Apple M1 Max 上，单流上传达到 <strong>12.25 Gbps</strong>，单流下载达到 <strong>13.97 Gbps</strong>，四流下载合计达到 <strong>20.61 Gbps</strong>。</p>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="测试结果">测试结果<a href="https://loon0x00.github.io/blog/loon4mac-tcp-performance#%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C" class="hash-link" aria-label="测试结果的直接链接" title="测试结果的直接链接">​</a></h2>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="测试环境">测试环境<a href="https://loon0x00.github.io/blog/loon4mac-tcp-performance#%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83" class="hash-link" aria-label="测试环境的直接链接" title="测试环境的直接链接">​</a></h3>
<table><thead><tr><th>项目</th><th>配置</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>设备</td><td>Apple M1 Max，32 GB 内存</td></tr><tr><td>系统</td><td>macOS 27.2</td></tr><tr><td>Loon</td><td>Loon4Mac build 1007</td></tr><tr><td>测试工具</td><td>Apple iperf3-darwin 3.8.1</td></tr><tr><td>TUN MTU</td><td>4000</td></tr></tbody></table>
<p>测试流量从本机发出，经 Loon 的 TUN 和 TCP 栈转发到本机 iperf3 服务端。每项预热 2 秒、测试 10 秒，各执行一次。</p>
<table><thead><tr><th>测试项目</th><th style="text-align:right">TCP 速度</th><th style="text-align:right">Loon NE RSS 峰值</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>单流上传</td><td style="text-align:right"><strong>12.25 Gbps</strong></td><td style="text-align:right">55.70 MiB</td></tr><tr><td>单流下载</td><td style="text-align:right"><strong>13.97 Gbps</strong></td><td style="text-align:right">59.28 MiB</td></tr><tr><td>四流上传（合计）</td><td style="text-align:right"><strong>10.67 Gbps</strong></td><td style="text-align:right">60.55 MiB</td></tr><tr><td>四流下载（合计）</td><td style="text-align:right"><strong>20.61 Gbps</strong></td><td style="text-align:right">90.23 MiB</td></tr></tbody></table>
<p>测试前 Loon NE 的空载 RSS 约为 46.45 MiB。四流结果是四条 TCP 连接的合计速度；RSS 是整个 Loon 网络扩展进程的内存，不是单条连接占用。</p>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="测试方法">测试方法<a href="https://loon0x00.github.io/blog/loon4mac-tcp-performance#%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95" class="hash-link" aria-label="测试方法的直接链接" title="测试方法的直接链接">​</a></h2>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="loon-配置">Loon 配置<a href="https://loon0x00.github.io/blog/loon4mac-tcp-performance#loon-%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE" class="hash-link" aria-label="Loon 配置的直接链接" title="Loon 配置的直接链接">​</a></h3>
<p>将以下内容合并到现有配置，<code>DOMAIN</code> 规则需要放在 <code>FINAL</code> 之前：</p>
<div class="language-ini codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_biex"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-ini codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">[Host]</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">bench.loon.test = 127.0.0.1</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">[Rule]</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">DOMAIN,bench.loon.test,DIRECT</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__atx"><button type="button" aria-label="复制代码到剪贴板" title="复制" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons_eSgA" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_y97N"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_LjdS"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
<p>保存配置并连接 Loon。<code>bench.loon.test</code> 不要加入 <code>real-ip</code>，也不要写入系统 <code>/etc/hosts</code>。</p>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="自动测试脚本">自动测试脚本<a href="https://loon0x00.github.io/blog/loon4mac-tcp-performance#%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95%E8%84%9A%E6%9C%AC" class="hash-link" aria-label="自动测试脚本的直接链接" title="自动测试脚本的直接链接">​</a></h3>
<p><a href="https://loon0x00.github.io/assets/files/loon4mac-tcp-test-2959e4bc50884968523cdfd2e10be1af.sh" target="_blank">下载 Loon4Mac TCP 测试脚本</a></p>
<p>下载后直接运行：</p>
<div class="language-bash codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_biex"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">/bin/bash ~/Downloads/loon4mac-tcp-test.sh</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__atx"><button type="button" aria-label="复制代码到剪贴板" title="复制" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons_eSgA" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_y97N"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_LjdS"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
<p>脚本会依次测试单流上传、单流下载、四流上传和四流下载，并记录 Loon NE 的 RSS，结果保存在当前目录。</p>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="手动测试">手动测试<a href="https://loon0x00.github.io/blog/loon4mac-tcp-performance#%E6%89%8B%E5%8A%A8%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95" class="hash-link" aria-label="手动测试的直接链接" title="手动测试的直接链接">​</a></h3>
<p>先在一个终端启动服务端：</p>
<div class="language-bash codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_biex"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">/usr/bin/arch -arm64 /usr/bin/iperf3-darwin -s -B 127.0.0.1 -p 5201</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__atx"><button type="button" aria-label="复制代码到剪贴板" title="复制" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons_eSgA" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_y97N"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_LjdS"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
<p>在另一个终端依次执行：</p>
<div class="language-bash codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_biex"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain"># 单流上传</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">/usr/bin/arch -arm64 /usr/bin/iperf3-darwin -c bench.loon.test -4 -p 5201 -O 2 -t 10 -i 1</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain"># 单流下载</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">/usr/bin/arch -arm64 /usr/bin/iperf3-darwin -c bench.loon.test -4 -p 5201 -O 2 -t 10 -i 1 -R</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain"># 四流上传</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">/usr/bin/arch -arm64 /usr/bin/iperf3-darwin -c bench.loon.test -4 -p 5201 -O 2 -t 10 -i 1 -P 4</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain"># 四流下载</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">/usr/bin/arch -arm64 /usr/bin/iperf3-darwin -c bench.loon.test -4 -p 5201 -O 2 -t 10 -i 1 -P 4 -R</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__atx"><button type="button" aria-label="复制代码到剪贴板" title="复制" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons_eSgA" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_y97N"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_LjdS"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
<p>单流查看最终的 <code>receiver</code>，四流查看 <code>[SUM] receiver</code>。客户端必须连接 <code>bench.loon.test</code>，如果直接连接 <code>127.0.0.1</code>，流量不会经过 Loon。</p>]]></content:encoded>
            <category>Loon4Mac</category>
            <category>性能测试</category>
            <category>macOS</category>
